      "title": "WiSUN: Do not store offset in a 8 bit integer",
      "message": "WiSUN: Do not store offset in a 8 bit integer\n\nThese can't overflow unlike the previous commit, but there's\nno advantage to storing the tvb offset in a 8 bit integer\n(we never want it to overflow, and in an expression the usual C\ninteger promotions will occur), and the code might be blindly\ncopied elsewhere.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2024-06-26T06:53:17.000-04:00",
